      "params": {
        "text": "ADSR envelope\n\n`sound/envelope` shapes amplitude over time using Attack / Decay / Sustain / Release. Wire an audio source through it, then re-trigger the gate to hear the shape.\n\nMouseY drives a gate (pressed = mouse below origin). Click the canvas to \"tap a note\".",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "ADSR envelope\n\n`sound/envelope` shapes amplitude over time using Attack / Decay / Sustain / Release. Wire an audio source through it, then re-trigger the gate to hear the shape.\n\nMouseY drives a gate (pressed = mouse below origin). Click the canvas to \"tap a note\".",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
